(7466874, 1184899, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge very well<br/> <br/>Scary or what?!? That must be where Im going wrong, perhaps I should get myself a chain! A great high contrast image Susan with all the malevolent atmosphere of film noir, its a great action capture. The very high contrast hides as much as it reveals, the identity is hidden but the intent is clear, it works very well. The voters obviously liked it too, a very respectable score and placing, well done Susan, just make sure you hide the chain away from him!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge very well Scary or what?!? That must be where Im going wrong, perhaps I should get myself a chain! A great high contrast image Susan with all the malevolent atmosphere of film noir, its a great action capture. The very high contrast hides as much as it reveals, the identity is hidden but the intent is clear, it works very well. The voters obviously liked it too, a very respectable score and placing, well done Susan, just make sure you hide the chain away from him!', '2016-08-03 08:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7466875, 1184878, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>I think it would take more than that message inscribed to tempt anyone into actually eating it! The rotten fruit has some lovely textures that you have captured well through your considered lighting, it works well. The message adds some additional interest to the image. Technically you have handled the exposure and lighting well. Thanks for your entry Joe</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge. I think it would take more than that message inscribed to tempt anyone into actually eating it! The rotten fruit has some lovely textures that you have captured well through your considered lighting, it works well. The message adds some additional interest to the image. Technically you have handled the exposure and lighting well. Thanks for your entry Joe', '2016-08-03 08:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7466877, 1184962, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge very well.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your HM placing, very well deserved. This is a lovely image, very well executed and set up, the moody atmosphere is enhanced by the empty dark space around her. The lighting from the window picks out her eyes very attractively and your accurate focus enhances that too. I like the way the lighting is picking out her necklace. Personally I would love to see the rest of her face but alternatively you could say that adds to the mystery of the shot. A great entry Eugene, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge very well. Congratulations on your HM placing, very well deserved. This is a lovely image, very well executed and set up, the moody atmosphere is enhanced by the empty dark space around her. The lighting from the window picks out her eyes very attractively and your accurate focus enhances that too. I like the way the lighting is picking out her necklace. Personally I would love to see the rest of her face but alternatively you could say that adds to the mystery of the shot. A great entry Eugene, well done.', '2016-08-03 08:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
